---
title: Kbd
description: A component for displaying keyboard keys and shortcuts.
---

<ComponentPreview name="p-kbd-1" />

## Installation

<InstallCommand
  pnpm="pnpm add @coss-sv/ui"
  shadcnSvelte="pnpm dlx shadcn-svelte@latest add https://coss-sv.vercel.app/r/kbd.json"
/>

## Usage

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
  import { Kbd, KbdGroup } from "@coss-sv/ui/components/ui/kbd";
</script>
```

Single key:

```svelte
<Kbd>K</Kbd>
```

Multiple keys:

```svelte
<KbdGroup>
  <Kbd>⌘</Kbd>
  <Kbd>K</Kbd>
</KbdGroup>
```

## API Reference

### Kbd

Displays a single keyboard key. Native `kbd` attributes pass to the element.

| Prop    | Type     | Default |
| ------- | -------- | ------- |
| `class` | `string` |         |

### KbdGroup

Groups multiple keyboard keys for key combinations.

| Prop    | Type     | Default |
| ------- | -------- | ------- |
| `class` | `string` |         |

